Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: logix
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, python3
Description: Privacy-first sign-in logbook for shared lab computers (core + CLI)
 Logix records who used a shared computer, when, and for what purpose --
 never screen contents or keystrokes. This package installs the
 cross-platform logging core, report generator, Google Sheets sync (with a
 redaction gate), the SSH-login hook, and the "logix" command.
 .
 Run "sudo logix configure" once after install. The physical at-keyboard
 sign-in prompt is Windows-only (shipped separately as LogixAgentSetup.exe).
